OL,3,A'Hero' pilot stabbed by other pilot on
OL,4,AIsrael-bound plane, Israeli PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pilot has been arrested after he
OL,7,Fstabbed the other pilot on a flight
OL,8,Ffrom Dubai to Tel Aviv and "apparently
OL,9,Ftried to crash the plane", Israeli
OL,10,FPrime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FPassengers and crew overpowered the
OL,14,Fattacker and retook control of the
OL,15,FFlydubai aircraft, landing it safely at
OL,16,Fan airport in Tabuk, northwestern Saudi
OL,17,FArabia, with more than 170 people on
OL,18,Fboard.
OL,20,FThe passengers, who were almost all
OL,21,FIsraeli, arrived later on Wednesday in
OL,22,FTel Aviv on a repatriation flight.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
