OL,3,A'Hero' pilot stabbed by other pilot on
OL,4,AIsrael-bound plane, Israeli PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stabbed pilot, named as Indian
OL,7,Fnational Captain Smit Machchhar, has
OL,8,Fbeen taken to hospital but is reported
OL,9,Fto be in a stable condition. Netanyahu
OL,10,Fand India's leader Narendra Modi
OL,11,Fpraised him as a "hero".
